{"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Inherits From","type":"inheritsFrom","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GLibObject\/4GLib14PointerWrapperP","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/ObjectProtocol"],"kind":"relationships"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/Binding","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingRef"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformingTypes","title":"Conforming Types"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Protocol","modules":[{"name":"GLibObject"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"BindingProtocol","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BindingProtocol","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"protocol","externalID":"s:10GLibObject15BindingProtocolP","title":"BindingProtocol"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"code":"GObject","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instance (or source) and another property on another ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GObject"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"instance (or target).","type":"text"}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/binding_ptr-9m3c1","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/flags","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/source","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/sourceProperty","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/target","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/targetProperty"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/bind(property:to:_:flags:transformFrom:transformTo:)","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/dupSource()","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/dupTarget()","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/get(property:)","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/getFlags()","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/getSource()","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/getSourceProperty()","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/getTarget()","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/getTargetProperty()","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/set(property:value:)","doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/unbind()"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/glibobject\/bindingprotocol"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"BindingProtocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/ObjectProtocol","text":"ObjectProtocol","preciseIdentifier":"s:10GLibObject0B8ProtocolP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Whenever the source property changes, the same value is applied to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"target property; for instance, the following binding:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"c","code":["  g_object_bind_property (object1, \"property-a\",","                          object2, \"property-b\",","                          G_BINDING_DEFAULT);"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"will cause the property named “property-b” of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"object2"},{"text":" to be updated","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"every time [method"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GObject.set"},{"type":"text","text":"] or the specific accessor changes the value of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the property “property-a” of "},{"code":"object1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is possible to create a bidirectional binding between two properties"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of two "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GObject"},{"text":" instances, so that if either property changes, the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"other is updated as well, for instance:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"c","code":["  g_object_bind_property (object1, \"property-a\",","                          object2, \"property-b\",","                          G_BINDING_BIDIRECTIONAL);"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"will keep the two properties in sync."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is also possible to set a custom transformation function (in both"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directions, in case of a bidirectional binding) to apply a custom","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"transformation from the source value to the target value before","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"applying it; for instance, the following binding:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["  g_object_bind_property_full (adjustment1, \"value\",","                               adjustment2, \"value\",","                               G_BINDING_BIDIRECTIONAL,","                               celsius_to_fahrenheit,","                               fahrenheit_to_celsius,","                               NULL, NULL);"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"c"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"will keep the “value” property of the two adjustments in sync; the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"celsius_to_fahrenheit"},{"text":" function will be called whenever the “value”","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"adjustment1"},{"type":"text","text":" changes and will transform the current value"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of the property before applying it to the “value” property of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"adjustment2"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Vice versa, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fahrenheit_to_celsius"},{"type":"text","text":" function will be called whenever"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the “value” property of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"adjustment2"},{"text":" changes, and will transform the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"current value of the property before applying it to the “value” property","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"adjustment1"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/Binding"},{"text":" does not resolve cycles by itself; a cycle like","type":"text"}]},{"code":["  object1:propertyA -> object2:propertyB","  object2:propertyB -> object3:propertyC","  object3:propertyC -> object1:propertyA"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"might lead to an infinite loop. The loop, in this particular case,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"can be avoided if the objects emit the ","type":"text"},{"code":"GObject","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"notify"},{"code":" signal only if the value has effectively been changed. A binding is implemented using the `GObject`notify","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" signal, so it is susceptible to all the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"various ways of blocking a signal emission, like [func"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GObject.signal_stop_emission"},{"type":"text","text":"]"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"or [func"},{"code":"GObject.signal_handler_block","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"]."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A binding will be severed, and the resources it allocates freed, whenever","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either one of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GObject"},{"type":"text","text":" instances it refers to are finalized, or when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/Binding","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" instance loses its last reference."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bindings for languages with garbage collection can use"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"[method"},{"code":"GObject.Binding.unbind","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"] to explicitly release a binding between the source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and target properties, instead of relying on the last reference on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"binding, source, and target instances to drop."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol exposes the methods and properties of an underlying "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GBinding"},{"type":"text","text":" instance."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"The default implementation of these can be found in the protocol extension below."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For a concrete class that implements these methods and properties, see "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/Binding"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Alternatively, use "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingRef"},{"type":"text","text":" as a lighweight, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"unowned"},{"text":" reference if you already have an instance you just want to use.","type":"text"}]}]}],"references":{"doc://GLibObject/documentation/GLibObject/BindingProtocol/getFlags()":{"url":"\/documentation\/glibobject\/bindingprotocol\/getflags()","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"getFlags","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10GLibObject12BindingFlagsV","text":"BindingFlags","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Retrieves the flags passed when constructing the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/Binding"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"getFlags()","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLibObject\/documentation\/GLibObject\/BindingProtocol\/getFlags()","kind":"symbol"},"doc://GLibObject/documentation/GLibObject/BindingProtocol":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"BindingProtocol"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"code":"GObject","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instance (or source) and another property on another "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GObject"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"instance (or target)."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/glibobject\/bindingp